.sdd/

# Local environment overrides (copy of .env.example); never commit real values
.env
# Local Claude Code artifacts. worktrees/ holds /sdd:work scratch checkouts;
# settings.local.json is the documented per-developer override; launch.json encodes
# machine-specific ports and whether to start or attach to a dev server.
# A shared launch.json could be committed later by removing that line.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/launch.json
.claude/settings.local.json
